<section id="intro" class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <p class="section-label hero__label">
    <span aria-hidden="true">01 / </span>jacob marriott · forward deployed engineer
  </p>

  <h1 id="hero-heading" class="hero__headline">
    Your team is spending hours on work that shouldn't exist.
    <span class="hero__headline-strong">I get them back to the job you hired them for.</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="hero__lede">
    I work inside small businesses,
    with the people doing the work, until I can see where their time is going.
    The fix might be a change to how things are done, a tool you can already
    buy, or software I build for you. I'll tell you which one it is before you
    commit to anything.
  </p>

  <p class="hero__cta-row">
    <a class="hero__cta" href="mailto:hello@jacobmarriott.com">
      tell me what's taking too long <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </p>

  <p class="hero__meta">
    <span>Brisbane</span>
    <span class="hero__meta-dot" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span>Queenstown</span>
    <span class="hero__meta-dot" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span>working across Australia &amp; New Zealand</span>
    <span class="hero__cursor" aria-hidden="true">▍</span>
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 4rem + 10vw, 12rem) clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 6rem);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .hero__label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
  }

  .hero__headline {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 3.2vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .hero__headline-strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .hero__lede {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 58ch;
    line-height: var(--leading-prose);
  }

  .hero__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-mono);
    text-transform: lowercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .hero__meta-dot {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
  }

  .hero__cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  .hero__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4em;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-mono);
    text-transform: lowercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.5em 0.9em;
    transition: background var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-expo),
                transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-expo);
  }

  .hero__cta span {
    transition: transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-expo);
  }

  .hero__cta:hover,
  .hero__cta:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .hero__cta:hover span,
  .hero__cta:focus-visible span {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .hero__cursor {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-left: 0.15em;
    transform: translateY(-0.05em);
    animation: cursor-blink 1.1s steps(1, end) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes cursor-blink {
    0%, 50%   { opacity: 1; }
    50.01%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero__cursor {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .hero__lede {
      padding-left: clamp(0rem, -2rem + 10vw, 8rem);
    }
    .hero__meta,
    .hero__cta-row {
      padding-left: clamp(0rem, -2rem + 10vw, 8rem);
    }
  }
</style>
